#: profileciscooptionsbase4.ui:486
msgctxt "Automatic keying has a property called perfect forward secrecy. This is the Diffie Hellman group for PFS."
msgid ""
"Sets the NAT traversal mode for cisco (vpnc >= 0.4.x)\n"
"\n"
"* natt - NAT-T as defined in RFC3947\n"
"* force-natt - always use NAT-T encapsulation even without presence of a NAT device (useful if the OS captures all ESP traffic)\n"
"* cisco-udp - Cisco proprietary UDP encapsulation, commonly over Port 10000\n"
msgstr ""
"De NAT-Dwarsloop-Metood för Cisco fastleggen (vpnc >= 0.4.x)\n"
"\n"
"* natt - NAT-T binnen RFC-3947 fastleggt\n"
"* force-natt - jümmers NAT-T-Verkapseln bruken, ok wenn dat keen NAT-Reedschap gifft (denn goot, wenn dat BS de helen ESP-Överdregen infangt)\n"
"* cisco-udp - Cisco sien egen UDP-Verkapseln, normalerwies över Port 10000\n"

