#. +> trunk
#: profileipsecoptions.cpp:98
msgid ""
"<h1>IPSec IKE algorithms</h1>"
"<p>You have to specify the IKE values in the following format:\n"
"<nobr>&lt;encryption algorithm&gt;-&lt;authentication algorithm&gt;</nobr>\n"
"or\n"
"<nobr>&lt;encryption algorithm&gt;-&lt;authentication algorithm&gt;-&lt;diffie hellman group&gt;</nobr></p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>IPSec-ISU-Algoritmen</h1>"
"<p>Du muttst de ISU-Weerten in dit Formaat angeven:\n"
"<nobr>&lt;Verslötel-Algoritmus&gt;-&lt;Identiteetprööv-Algoritmus&gt;</nobr>\n"
"oder\n"
"<nobr>&lt;Verslötel-Algoritmus&gt;-&lt;Identiteetprööv-Algoritmus&gt;-&lt;Diffie-Hellman-Koppel&gt;</nobr></p>"

#. +> trunk
#: profileipsecoptions.cpp:110
msgid ""
"<h1>IPSec ESP algorithms</h1>"
"<nobr>You have to specify the ESP values in the following format:\n"
"<b>&lt;encryption algorithm&gt;-&lt;authentication algorithm&gt;</nobr>\n"
"or\n"
"<nobr>&lt;encryption algorithm&gt;-&lt;authentication algorithm&gt;-&lt;diffie hellman group&gt;</nobr></p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>IPSec-ESP-Algoritmen</h1>"
"<p>Du muttst de ESP-Weerten in dit Formaat angeven:\n"
"<nobr>&lt;Verslötel-Algoritmus&gt;-&lt;Identiteetprööv-Algoritmus&gt;</nobr>\n"
"oder\n"
"<nobr>&lt;Verslötel-Algoritmus&gt;-&lt;Identiteetprööv-Algoritmus&gt;-&lt;Diffie-Hellman-Koppel&gt;</nobr></p>"

